dardized access to MCU peripherals."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Port"},{"text":"Dio"},{"text":"Adc"},{"text":"Pwm"},{"text":"Spi"},{"text":"I2c"},{"text":"Can"},{"text":"Lin"},{"text":"Mcu"},{"text":"Wdg"},{"text":"Gpt"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Conceptually:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AUTOSAR BSW","MCAL","Microcontroller Hardware"]}]},{"heading":"AUTOSAR Configuration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A major practical skill is configuration."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECU configuration"},{"text":"ARXML"},{"text":"System description"},{"text":"ECU extract"},{"text":"Software Component description"},{"text":"RTE configuration"},{"text":"BSW configuration"},{"text":"Communication configuration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirements","System Description","AUTOSAR Configuration","Code Generation","Compilation","ECU Software"]}]},{"heading":"ARXML","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to understand and work with AUTOSAR XML (ARXML)."},{"type":"p","text":"You should be comfortable identifying:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Packages"},{"text":"Data types"},{"text":"Interfaces"},{"text":"Ports"},{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Runnables"},{"text":"ECU configuration"},{"text":"Communication definitions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not treat ARXML as simply a configuration file; understand how it represents the automotive software architecture."}]},{"heading":"AUTOSAR Adaptive","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After Classic, learn AUTOSAR Adaptive."},{"type":"p","text":"Adaptive AUTOSAR is particularly relevant to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"High-performance computing"},{"text":"ADAS"},{"text":"Autonomous driving"},{"text":"Infotainment"},{"text":"Connected vehicles"},{"text":"Software-defined vehicles"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Adaptive Application","AUTOSAR Adaptive Platform","POSIX-based OS","High-Performance Computing Hardware"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Services"},{"text":"Service-oriented architecture"},{"text":"SOME/IP"},{"text":"Execution Management"},{"text":"Communication Management"},{"text":"Adaptive applications"},{"text":"POSIX/Linux concepts"}]}]},{"heading":"Software-Defined Vehicles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern automotive software is moving toward centralized and zonal architectures."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Domain controllers"},{"text":"Zonal controllers"},{"text":"Vehicle computers"},{"text":"Service-oriented architecture"},{"text":"Over-the-air updates"},{"text":"Automotive Ethernet"},{"text":"Cloud-connected vehicles"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Architecture trend:"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional"},{"type":"flow","items":["ECU → ECU → ECU → ECU","Domain Architecture","Zonal Architecture","Central Vehicle Computer"]},{"type":"p","text":"This makes AUTOSAR knowledge increasingly valuable when combined with modern software architecture."}]},{"heading":"Functional Safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Automotive software requires strong safety engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn ISO 26262 concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Functional safety"},{"text":"Hazard analysis"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"ASIL"},{"text":"Safety goals"},{"text":"Safety requirements"},{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Safety mechanisms"},{"text":"Diagnostic coverage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hazard","Risk Analysis","Safety Goal","Safety Requirement","Software Requirement","Implementation","Verification"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a student, understanding the engineering principles is more important initially than memorizing every standard clause."}]},{"heading":"Automotive Cybersecurity","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern vehicles are connected systems."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Secure boot"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Encryption"},{"text":"Key management"},{"text":"Secure diagnostics"},{"text":"ECU security"},{"text":"Intrusion detection"},{"text":"Threat modeling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ISO/SAE 21434"},{"text":"UNECE R155"},{"text":"UNECE R156"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"TARA"},{"text":"Secure OTA"},{"text":"Cybersecurity lifecycle"},{"text":"Security monitoring"}]}]},{"heading":"Testing & Debugging","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AUTOSAR developers need strong debugging skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Unit Testing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Test cases"},{"text":"Mocking"},{"text":"Boundary testing"},{"text":"Static analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Integration Testing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECU integration"},{"text":"Communication testing"},{"text":"Interface validation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"System Testing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HIL"},{"text":"SIL"},{"text":"MIL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["MIL","SIL","PIL","HIL","Vehicle Testing"]}]},{"heading":"Automotive Development Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with categories of industry tools."},{"type":"h","text":"AUTOSAR / Configuration"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vector DaVinci"},{"text":"EB tresos"},{"text":"Elektrobit tooling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CAN / Diagnostics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CANoe"},{"text":"CANalyzer"},{"text":"CANape"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Debugging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lauterbach TRACE32"},{"text":"JTAG"},{"text":"MCU vendor debuggers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GCC"},{"text":"CMake"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Jenkins"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Many commercial automotive tools require company licenses, so students should use university labs, trial versions, educational programs or open-source alternatives where available."}]},{"heading":"Five Recommended Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Mini AUTOSAR-Style ECU"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simplified layered ECU architecture:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Application","RTE-like Interface","Service Layer","MCAL Abstraction","Hardware / Simulator"]},{"type":"p","text":"Implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GPIO"},{"text":"Timer"},{"text":"ADC"},{"text":"CAN abstraction"},{"text":"Diagnostics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — CAN-Based Vehicle Network"},{"type":"p","text":"Create two or more simulated ECUs."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 1 — Engine"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ CAN"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 2 — Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"↓ CAN"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 3 — Body Control"},{"type":"p","text":"Implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAN messages"},{"text":"Signal encoding"},{"text":"Message scheduling"},{"text":"Error detection"},{"text":"Diagnostics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — UDS Diagnostic ECU"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simulated diagnostic server supporting selected UDS services."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnostic sessions"},{"text":"ECU reset"},{"text":"Read data"},{"text":"DTC management"},{"text":"Security-access simulation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the protocol flow carefully."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — AUTOSAR Software Component"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an AUTOSAR-style Software Component model."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Speed Sensor","Sensor SWC","RTE","Vehicle Speed SWC","Dashboard SWC"]},{"type":"p","text":"Implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ports"},{"text":"Interfaces"},{"text":"Runnables"},{"text":"Periodic tasks"},{"text":"Data exchange"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Automotive Ethernet / Adaptive AUTOSAR Prototype"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Linux-based service-oriented vehicle prototype."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Vehicle Sensor Service","SOME/IP-like Communication","ADAS Application","Dashboard Service"]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"C++"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Service-oriented architecture"},{"text":"Docker where appropriate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates the transition from traditional ECU software toward software-defined vehicles."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AUTOSAR Developer Intern"},{"text":"Embedded Software Intern"},{"text":"Automotive Software Intern"},{"text":"ECU Software Intern"},{"text":"Automotive Testing Intern"},{"text":"ADAS Software Intern"},{"text":"Vehicle Electronics Intern"},{"text":"Embedded C Developer Intern"},{"text":"Automotive Cybersecurity Intern"},{"text":"Functional Safety Intern"},{"text":"Automotive Ethernet Intern"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["unavailable, Embedded C","Automotive ECU","CAN internships are excellent stepping stones."],"sep":"+","label":"If an AUTOSAR-specific internship is"}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Graduates can target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AUTOSAR Developer"},{"text":"AUTOSAR Software Engineer"},{"text":"Embedded Software Engineer"},{"text":"Automotive Embedded Engineer"},{"text":"ECU Software Developer"},{"text":"BSW Developer"},{"text":"MCAL Developer"},{"text":"RTE Developer"},{"text":"Automotive Application Developer"},{"text":"Vehicle Software Engineer"},{"text":"Diagnostics Engineer"},{"text":"Automotive Communication Engineer"},{"text":"ADAS Software Engineer"},{"text":"Automotive Integration Engineer"},{"text":"Automotive Testing Engi